 zelf richting te geven. Het historische verhaal volgt haar zoektocht naar vrijheid in het Amsterdam van de achttiende eeuw.","source_type":"official_catalog","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_url":"https://www.passendlezen.nl/iguana/uploads/file/Passend%20Lezen%20-%20Aanwinstenlijst%202021%20-%20braille%20-%202e%20half%20jaar%202021%20%28juli%20-%20december%29.pdf","evidence":[{"type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p14407818X"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-045.json#134","checked_at":"2026-11-03T09:13:56.273Z","note":"SaartjeTadema original1996 not1976; DutchHardcover9789056370190/Lemniscaat. Libraryfirsteditionnote1996; no adaptation/omnibus."},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","sources":["https://www.passendlezen.nl/iguana/uploads/file/Passend%20Lezen%20-%20Aanwinstenlijst%202021%20-%20braille%20-%202e%20half%20jaar%202021%20%28juli%20-%20december%29.pdf","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL1736490W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p14407818X"],"review":"content-review-010.json"},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","editionKey":"/books/OL312232M","isbn13":"9789056370190","checkedAt":"2026-11-03T09:13:56.273Z","note":"Exactsource-coverattempt retained; noverifiedasset imported. Inspect actualsameeditionresolver or documentedneutralplaceholder hosted. No cross-editionlanguagecover replacement.","attempts":[{"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","coverId":15176737,"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","receiptSha256":"e708a18cf8cc616bac8188db448d09c721bd2d5d82f72c5bce761890bae30c14"}],"limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"provenance":"original_source_